[00077]-This looks like it may once have been an armory, various bits and peices of broken swords, daggars, and other weapons litter the floor. Doorways lead north, east, and south. The north and east doors are glowing with a faint blue glow. A dark red glow is visible from the southern doorway.
[00078]-This room is a disused kitchen, empty cupboards line the eastern wall. In the center of the room is a large fire pit. Exits are through doorways to the north, west and south. The north and west doorways are glowing with a faint blue. The southern doorway is emiting a deep red glow.
